      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We report 3 cases of fatal neutropenia and thrombocytopenia associated with ticlopidine after coronary stenting. Patients should be counseled about the early signs of infection and bleeding and to have regularly scheduled complete blood counts."},
